1
00:00:00,935 --> 00:00:04,175
(Penny:)Yeah. I'm tapping out.
Leonard?

2
00:00:04,172 --> 00:00:06,572
(Leonard:)I'm gonna guess that your main
concern is the time commitment

3
00:00:06,574 --> 00:00:08,944
(Leonard:)of watching an entire season
of a new show.

4
00:00:08,943 --> 00:00:10,273
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, not just a season.

5
00:00:10,278 --> 00:00:12,278
(Sheldon:)If I'm in,
I'm in for the whole run,

6
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:15,150
(Sheldon:)even if the quality declines.

7
00:00:15,149 --> 00:00:17,849
(Leonard:)I get it.
Smallville almost wrecked you.

8
00:00:17,852 --> 00:00:20,582
(Sheldon:)Yeah. Exactly.

9
00:00:20,588 --> 00:00:21,918
(Sheldon:)You know, I waited ten years

10
00:00:21,923 --> 00:00:24,423
(Sheldon:)to see a guy
everyone knows can fly, fly.

11
00:00:24,425 --> 00:00:26,755
(Penny:)Wait, what is wrong
with you two?

12
00:00:26,761 --> 00:00:29,331
(Penny:)He was talking about television
during their date night.

13
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:32,330
(Sheldon:)Oh, not just date night--
our fifth anniversary.

14
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:34,133
(Penny:)Okay, see, that's even dumber
than you wondering

15
00:00:34,135 --> 00:00:37,705
(Penny:)if being bitten by a goat would
give you the powers of a goat.

16
00:00:39,806 --> 00:00:42,146
(Sheldon:)If that happens,
don't make me wait ten years

17
00:00:42,143 --> 00:00:44,273
(Sheldon:)to watch you eat a tin can.

18
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:49,780
(Raj:)You guys ever notice that Emily
has a bit of a twisted side?

19
00:00:49,784 --> 00:00:51,684
(Bernadette:)You mean
'cause she has weird tattoos?

20
00:00:51,686 --> 00:00:54,656
(Raj:)No, because she wants to have
sex with me in a graveyard.

21
00:00:56,657 --> 00:00:59,627
(Howard:)One more time?

